// P3B.9 / A1.3, A1.4, X16 Relations on the mechanisms stand-in (`fixtures/relations_standin.cadrs`:
// on a fixed Base, a 12-tooth and a 24-tooth gear on Revolutes 1 and 2, a pinion on Revolute 3
// over a rack on Slider 1, a nut on a fixed screw (Cylindrical 1), two slides on Sliders 2 and 3;
// each gear and the pinion has a marker hole, so their turns show).
// 01 The Mechanisms Assembly: seven mates, no relations.
// 02 (A1.4) The toolbar's Relations button: its menu of Gear, Rack and pinion, Screw and Linear.
// 03 The Gear relation dialog: Revolute 1 and Revolute 2 clicked in the Mate Features list, ratio
//    2 : 1 (the first turns twice while the second turns once).
// 04 ✓: "Gear 1" in the Mate Features list (its tooltip: ratio, mates).
// 05–06 Animate Revolute 1 to 90°: the 12-tooth gear turns a quarter turn, the 24-tooth gear an
//    eighth the other way, their teeth meshing (05 part way, at 67.5°; 06 at 90°: the markers show it).
// 07 Rack and pinion: Revolute 3 (the pinion) and Slider 1 (the rack), 94.248 mm per revolution
//    (2π × the pinion's 15 mm pitch radius).
// 08–09 Animate Revolute 3 to −90° (08 part way, at −67.5°): the rack travels with the
//    pinion's teeth, 23.6 mm (πr/2).
// 10 Screw: Cylindrical 1 (pitch 5 mm); Animate its Z angle over four turns: the nut climbs 20 mm.
// 11 Linear: Slider 2 and Slider 3, ratio 2.
// 12 Dragging Slide A: Slide B moves twice as far.
// 13 The Mate Features list: Gear 1, Rack and pinion 1, Screw 1, Linear 1 (Linear 1's ▸: its mates).
// 14 Undo (the drag, then Linear 1): Linear 1 is gone.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        Wait(10),
        Custom("fixture relations_standin"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("tab-mechanisms-assembly")),
        Wait(10),
        Custom("view 15 55 0 -10 0 0.36"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-x16-mechanisms-assembly"),
        Click(ui("relations")),
        WaitFor("relations-menu-gear-relation"),
        Hover(ui("relations-menu-gear-relation")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-a1.4-relations-menu"),
        Click(ui("relations-menu-gear-relation")),
        WaitFor("relation-dialog"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("mate-row-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("mate-row-2")),
        Wait(3),
